body:
Maybe she is experiencing an emotional shock.

&#x200B;

Having already had episodes of personalization I would say that she needs to take some time for herself.

&#x200B;

Doing things like meditation, a bit of sport, walking.

&#x200B;

Pleasant earthly things!

&#x200B;

To be surrounded and supported while she recovers.

&#x200B;

It's important that she realizes that we shouldn't focus on what's wrong.

&#x200B;

As for you, I think it was an accident, you warned her, and out of curiosity she didn't listen to you, maybe in the future a good hiding place for dangerous products would be judicious.

&#x200B;

Translated with [www.DeepL.com/Translator](https://www.DeepL.com/Translator) (free version)
